			"notes": "This is a primary alpha release being made for the purposes of setting up distribution.\n\n## What has been tested\n- player vibrations still trigger all sculk shriekers\n- walking on a shrieker triggers the shrieker\n- naturally spawning shkriekers can still summon the warden\n- non-player vibrations do not trigger naturally spawning shkriekers\n- non-player vibrations *do* trigger placed skriekers\n- tested on a minimal Minecraft 1.20 setup (just Fabric, no other mods, not even Fabric API)\n- tested on a full Minecraft 1.20.1 setup (Sodium, Iris, Indium, SoundPhysicsRemastered...)\n\n## What has not been tested\n- Whether this is truly a \"server-only\" mod"
